=== D. Calc note #2 narrow-gate substitution vs the linearized result (contact range) ===
3a: g n_gate/(m v*^2) >= 1 with n_gate = n (v*/sigma)^3/(2pi)^1.5   [sigma -> v*]
exact static: g n Lam(r)/(m sigma^2) >= 1, Lam(r) = top eigenvalue of p0^1/2 W p0^1/2 (gate alone)
ratio R = (g required, exact)/(g required, 3a narrow form) = (2pi)^-1.5 r^-1 / Lam(r)  [Gaussian W = exp(-s^2/2)]
